@startuml
participant Caller
participant DependencyManifest as Manifest
participant ArchiveVerifier as Archives
participant PayloadBinding as Payload
participant ToolchainProbe as Probe
participant BuildEnvelope as Build
Caller -> Manifest: load explicit manifest and compiled lock
Manifest -> Archives: verified identities
Archives -> Payload: extracted complete reference tree
alt prerequisite failure
  Payload --> Caller: classified failure
else bound payload
  Payload -> Probe: admitted prefix
  Probe -> Build: configure/build with selected compiler
  Build --> Caller: policy evidence or classified failure
end
@enduml
